+      "not_proven": "Low overrange is not itself evidence that the analog input is safe."
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "V15_REARM_REQUIRES_DRAINED_SLOTS",
+      "focus": "explicit re-arm boundary",
+      "stimulus": [
+        "After overrange is low, leave one result slot full and pulse arm.",
+        "Then consume the remaining result and issue a new rising arm pulse while overrange=0 and the master is idle."
+      ],
+      "expected": [
+        "The first arm pulse is ignored; inhibit stays 1 and armed stays 0.",
+        "The later valid pulse sets armed=1, clears inhibit, clears fallback state, and keeps host_gate=0 until a post-arm host_valid=0 cycle is observed.",
+        "No old host request is restarted."
