+      "expected": [
+        "master_cancel is asserted and the 76 master returns a digital error terminal for tagA when the operation is active.",
+        "The wrapper stores tagA/error in the host slot and clears host_inflight; no safety fallback is pending solely because of cancel.",
+        "armed is cleared, enable recovery does not auto-arm, and the held result remains until consumed."
+      ],
+      "not_proven": "Cancel does not guarantee analog state or eliminate a partial-frame effect."
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "V17_DISABLE_DURING_FALLBACK_NO_RETRY",
+      "focus": "fallback failure/refusal",
+      "stimulus": [
+        "Issue fallback tagS/gain0, then assert enable=0 (or cancel) while the safety transaction is active.",
+        "Return enable=1 and leave overrange low, but do not pulse arm."
